 "official_summary": " <p><strong>Human Trafficking Prevention Act of 2022</strong></p> <p>This act requires the posting of contact information of the national human trafficking hotline in specific places.</p> <p>Specifically, the information must be posted</p> <ul> <li>in a visible place in all federal buildings;</li> <li>in the restrooms of each U.S. aircraft, airport, over-the-road bus, bus station, passenger train, and passenger railroad station; and</li> <li>at each port of entry.</li> </ul>",
